I've got some bad news, Father.

65
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,017
This is as far as I can go.

66
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:17,930
My apologies.

67
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,517
Please let Let me call
another cab for you.

68
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,600
Thank you, but there is no need.

69
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,820
I'm not in any hurry.

70
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:32,026
I have a week until I'm born anew, and
I'm still in terrible physical condition.

71
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:34,820
Just five more days until the new moon.

72
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:37,596
Guess I can wait it out in this town.

73
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:41,571
I'll need to keep Jolene and
her friends away at all costs.

74
