Remember, at this theme park, the
mascot's a really famous character.

167
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,424
Perhaps you might even know it.

168
00:11:43,740 --> 00:11:46,093
This guidebook is a total piece of crap.

169
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:49,614
It doesn't even show any of
the famous characters in it.

170
00:11:59,140 --> 00:12:01,457
Hey something's running around back here

171
