Chill, chill, there's nothing
to panic about here, buddy.

234
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,297
Who were you a fan of when you were a kid?

235
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:16,557
You know, who's your favorite character?

236
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:18,228
Maybe it was little old me?

237
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:21,337
Personally, I've got a thing
for the Terminator T-1000.

238
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:22,777
That guy ain't on the truck, though.

239
00:15:22,860 --> 00:15:24,780
Me and my bro like Chewbacca.

240
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:26,449
And the Elephant Man, too.

241
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:30,836
But no matter what, our Princess Snow
White is the best character ever!

242
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:32,130
I do!

243
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:34,457
We know all the rumors about us?

244
00:15:34,540 --> 00:15:36,457
Like how we like to sneak
into a girl's panties!

245
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:38,837
and do dirty things to
her, but they're lies.

246
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:41,940
Our relationship's
platonic all the way. Yeah!

247
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:50,820
These, these guys are,
they're so familiar.

248
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,140
I know them.

249
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:56,820
I mean, I know what they are,
but what the hell's going on?

250
00:15:57,260 --> 00:15:59,020
We have breaking news.

251
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:03,297
Today at 1.30 PM, Batman suddenly
disappeared from all over the world.

252
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:05,840
I repeat, the beloved Batman is gone.

253
